# This project reads no credentials. It is paper-only: no live orders, no exchange API
# keys, no withdrawals (docs/START_HERE.md step 1, SECURITY.md). Market data comes from
# Binance's public, unauthenticated endpoints.
#
# The exchange key and secret slots that used to be here were read by nothing in src/ or
# scripts/, and advertised exactly the credential the rules forbid, so they were removed.
# Never commit real credentials to this or any file.
